drashta web scaffold is ready (h-web-shell).

COMMANDS (run in web/)
  npm install          install (already done; do not add packages without a reason)
  npm run dev          Vite on :5173, /api proxied to the Go server on :4455 (SSE not buffered)
  npm run dev:mock     Vite on :5174 with MSW in the browser, no Go server needed
  npm test             Vitest (jsdom + React Testing Library + MSW node server)
  npx vitest run app/components/home   run only your folder
  npm run build        SPA build into build/client (then rewrites build/client/.keep for go:embed)
  npm run typecheck    react-router typegen + tsc (strict)
  npm run e2e          Playwright smoke test (headless, starts dev:mock itself)
  npm run fixtures     regenerate app/mocks/fixtures/db.json (invented data, deterministic)

